{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_07",
  "title": "“屏風衛”",
  "storyCode": "WB-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d0734014ede6eddabe44e7d74c8c10172d8858d373be7a021d4883fcd7ebe384",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個，兩個，三個。\n揮錘。\n七千多個日夜，他都如此般揮錘。\n他多麼希望錘頭不是落在未成形的鐵坯，而是仇人的刀刃上，頭顱上。\n就像，現在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們退下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......錘很沉，但不夠快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很沉就夠了，很沉就能砸斷你的刀，再砸爛你的腦袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，我原本為你們設計了更好的死法。我本應該在這間倉庫裡埋滿炸藥，天災來的時候，用你們山海眾的命為玉門祭旗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，包括我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這才是你的計劃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然，我為什麼要主動找你們合作？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們似乎，沒有這麼大的仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當初你們是如何混進玉門，如何喬裝成武人騙取守軍信任，如何到處作亂，玉門又是如何變成今天的樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "記性，未免太差！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們這幫宵小出現在城裡的第一天，我就認出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可是等了你們，二十年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜啊可惜，一點意外，滿盤皆輸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但幸好，我還有這把錘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "倉庫裡光線昏暗，林雨霞手上的玻璃劍刃反而越發透明。\n山海眾似乎對她精妙的源石技藝有些忌憚，沒有一擁而上，而是彼此配合，慢慢縮小著包圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（這樣一夥人，居然能在城市裡神出鬼沒這麼久不被發現......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不是民間的武術流派，也不是哪國的軍方格鬥術，但狠辣凌厲，而且遠近分工，配合默契......究竟是什麼來歷？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（如果是陳的劍，大概更適合對付這些傢伙......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（瞎想什麼......當務之急是要想辦法儘快脫身，把真的數據帶出去。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，我來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不該還留在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛把大小齊送出去，聽到這邊有打鬥聲——果然又是這夥人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊伍裡的信使和守軍也沒事——孟鐵衣把他們軟禁了起來，但沒傷害他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別這麼看著我，我沒說原諒你了。收拾完這幫人，我還是會找你算帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就想辦法至少先活下來，這幫人可不好對付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用你提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遙夜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姓孟的你不許這麼叫我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你已經知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走神？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我憑什麼閉嘴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是說你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，沒事就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我手刃了這個仇人，再來給你賠禮道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你憑什麼，用這種好像很解脫的語氣跟我說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為沒有人真的喪命，因為一切還在你的掌握之中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然一開始就要演一場信使被殺的戲，何必答應我讓大小齊加入隊伍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿別人的性命做局，枉城裡那麼多兄弟拿你當最德高望重的前輩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說實話，我不是沒有動搖過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你興沖沖地找上門，說要開玉門第一家現代物流公司，一邊拍著胸脯大講規劃，一邊讓我不用看你爹鄭清鉞的面子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多少讓人懷念年輕的歲月！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身前每一刀的力道都越來越重，身後女孩也罵得越來越激烈。\n孟鐵衣不再說話，咬著牙揮錘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得你說過，自己好歹曾經也是玉門城裡響噹噹的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年輕的時候跟著宗師練武殺敵，快意恩仇，為了替被劫掠的百姓討回公道，在大漠裡追出去一百多里端掉流寇的窩點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉門有多少條街、多少間鋪子、多少個營帳，城裡參軍的兄弟來自大炎哪些地方，你都心裡有數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在呢，現在的玉門，你真的關心過嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你比我那個守著走鏢的老規矩不肯鬆手的爹，還要迂腐，還要糊塗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "時代是會變的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鏢局要變成物流公司，鑄劍坊要變成鐵匠鋪，沒人能攔得住，也不應該攔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再恨、你再怨，也沒資格因為現在的玉門不是當年的玉門，就要引一場天災來考驗它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你憑什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你對得起這座城市嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姓孟的，你對得起，你自己嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杜遙夜，當心——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "孟鐵衣一直沒有回頭。\n高手之間的對決，容不下一絲一毫的分心，更何況對手是這個神秘莫測的女人。\n他也不確定自己有沒有聽清楚杜遙夜那個小輩罵的是什麼，只覺得很大聲，夾雜著很多情緒。\n但他偏偏又聽清了林雨霞的那句示警，而且下意識地回了頭。\n孟鐵衣將手中的鐵錘扔了出去，擊飛了靠近杜遙夜身後的敵人。\n狹長的刀鋒同時劃開他的脊背。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "孟叔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行裕物流是個好主意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總不能，看著好苗子折在我眼前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你有沒有想過，你口中的江湖還在，只是變了個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來，到你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人跨過了地上的那具屍體。\n血順著長刀滴落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然護送信使的任務是個局，那行裕物流等於還沒有真正開張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道如果我委託行裕物流送件東西，杜小姐願不願意接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個匣子裡是真正的天災數據，務必交給平祟侯。你拿著我的權杖，他會相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後祈禱一切都還來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少來這套，讓我逃走，你自己留下來逞英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該清楚，我沒那麼好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但總要有一個人把數據送出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個女人的武功深不可測，連孟鐵衣也死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憑我的源石技藝，或許能拖住他們，為你創造幾秒鐘的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "開什麼玩笑？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是覺得自己有辦法拖住他們，我們交換也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿你朋友的事騙你，對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騙我的不止你一個，剛剛罵孟鐵衣的時候，已經順帶罵了你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有，忘了告訴你。其實我覺得，一個人來這麼遠的地方打拼事業，很了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別扯這些沒用的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你記住，你要是逃不出去，玉門城也逃不過這場天災了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是個大單子，行裕物流接了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閉上眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞抖手，玻璃碎片掉落在地的瞬間化為流沙。\n角落裡，天花板上，細碎的沙粒像是群溪匯流，飛快地聚攏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙塵揚起。\n狹窄的倉庫內，捲起了一場沙暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊是不是有什麼東西燒起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人縱火？過去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那沙渠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有誰會來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "城頭報時的軍笛響過一輪，天色已暗，雲層間隱約已經能看到圓月的輪廓。\n老刀匠如果辦完事情，回到鑄劍坊發現她不在，應該能想到來沙渠找自己。\n移動城市的基座咬開地面，高速運轉的輪機將過大的障礙物嚼碎，混著成噸的沙礫一併吐出，聲響震耳欲聾。\n老刀匠說得沒錯，這裡沒什麼軍士看守，因為不會有人想以這種方式出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（約定的時間馬上就到了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長相兇狠的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（兇狠的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三番兩次被你逃脫，你倒好，自己又走到死路上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不認識你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你背上的劍，與我們的計劃無關，但藏有歲獸十二分之一意識的物件，有人很感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歲獸？你說什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看起來一無所知。那就更不配拿著這把劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "腦後的黑色光環......你是阿納薩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是又怎樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個阿納薩，居然和炎國移動城市裡的人打成一片，可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你忘了自己的出身？忘了你族人的遭遇？在荒野上吃苦受難，為了溫飽四處流浪的時候，炎國幾時幫過你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿納薩，你應該加入山海眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只看到，你們在城市裡到處幹壞事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......愚不可及的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沙塵馬上就要散了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（連魏長官和爸聯手都贏不了的敵人，我不可能是她的對手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（但至少要再拖她一會，給杜遙夜爭取更多脫身的時間......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在害怕我，卻把逃生的機會留給別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多少年來，你們好像從來沒有變過。把英勇赴死當成一種榮譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒那麼高尚，也沒打算就這樣死在你手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲脆響，下一秒，黃沙已經在女人面前重新凝聚成玻璃劍刃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搶攻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們似乎很喜歡玩這種小把戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忽略力量懸殊的搶攻，只是找死。\n到頭來，用了那麼多“手段”，逼出一個孟鐵衣，拿到了天災數據。\n自己應該能算是......做了件好事？\n算吧。\n玻璃劍刃一寸寸崩壞，長刀已經落在她的眉心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀劍相擊，空氣被摩擦出銳響，林雨霞的劍在沙粒與玻璃間來回切換，無數浮空的透明碎片折射出一個人的身影。\n她站在自己的身前，挺拔得像是一棵胡楊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼知道我會來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大老遠就看見你的源石技藝，我以為是在向我求救來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少自作多情，我可從沒聽說你會來玉門——\n你為什麼會來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碰巧路過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你又像多索雷斯那次一樣尾隨我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那次難道不是你尾隨我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實是聽說魏長官遭遇了刺殺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有空囉嗦，不如先給我解釋解釋，這裡到底什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙塵終於完全散去，倉庫中已空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒空解釋了，去城門口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "杜遙夜來到玉門已經有段時間了，她從沒覺得玉門的街道有這麼長。\n這幾百米的平路，彷彿比尋日峰的山道還要難走。懷裡抱著的小匣子，比挑山人擔子上的山石還要重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鏢局也好，物流也好，萬變不離其宗，賭上的是人命，為的也是人命。想要打出這行的招牌，就得知道肩上的份量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爹以前不厭其煩講的那些護鏢的故事，自己其實都記得。\n都是一樣的道理，偏偏經歷了才懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（快一點，快一點......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（已經能看到城門了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些人已經追上來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聽風辨器的本領，杜遙夜學過。心無旁騖的話，這一箭她肯定能躲掉。\n箭矢貫穿了她的右肩，匣子從懷裡滑出來，她趕忙伸出左手去接，結果連人帶物摔倒在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的山海眾成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滅口，拿東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杜小姐！"
