      "speakerName": "兇狠的山海眾成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放肆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "匹練，雪，或者是劍光。\n整齊斷成兩截的箭矢落了一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
