      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近玉門城裡風波不斷，都是這個人主使的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓她興風作浪了這些天，也該到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都小心點，她的源石技藝，很古怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸和魏長官聯手都沒有留住她，這個人不知道還有多少歪門邪道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以說，這個女人，就是刺殺魏彥吾的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "笑話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好在這裡解決了她，回去可以好好嘲笑魏彥吾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在這裡了結吧。"
